  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "PRISMA flow diagram of study selection for STANDARD M10 and other new LC-aNAATs. From 37 database records (3 duplicates removed), 34 were screened, 32 excluded and 2 reports assessed for eligibility; both were excluded (an ongoing trial and a conference abstract/case-control study). No studies were included.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
